            "detailed_description": "Banido de sua terra natal por acreditar que os anões podiam viver na superfície, você decide construir uma nova aldeia segundo a sua ideologia. Torne-se líder e cumpra missões, fabrique itens e derrote inimigos para manter a segurança e a felicidade dos habitantes. Quanto maior a aldeia, maior a aventura!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Características</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Construa mais de 45 estruturas, como fazendas, cervejarias, ferrarias e cozinhas<br></li><li>Explore o mundo em várias masmorras, cavernas, minas e muito mais<br></li><li>Cumpra missões e administre a aldeia para a segurança e a felicidade dos cidadãos<br></li><li>Fabrique mais de 100 itens tais como armaduras, armas e decorações para casa<br></li><li>Lute contra inimigos poderosos num sistema de combate rápido e ágil.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
            "about_the_game": "Banido de sua terra natal por acreditar que os anões podiam viver na superfície, você decide construir uma nova aldeia segundo a sua ideologia. Torne-se líder e cumpra missões, fabrique itens e derrote inimigos para manter a segurança e a felicidade dos habitantes. Quanto maior a aldeia, maior a aventura!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/c3217fadfbfd41d9421f0b687675de94.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Características</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Construa mais de 45 estruturas, como fazendas, cervejarias, ferrarias e cozinhas<br></li><li>Explore o mundo em várias masmorras, cavernas, minas e muito mais<br></li><li>Cumpra missões e administre a aldeia para a segurança e a felicidade dos cidadãos<br></li><li>Fabrique mais de 100 itens tais como armaduras, armas e decorações para casa<br></li><li>Lute contra inimigos poderosos num sistema de combate rápido e ágil.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/5cb78419c18df87a78440b90e42e389d.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.poster.avif?t=1684433404\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.webm?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/664000/extras/25c6db8804f98e1e5fbc4631136f6780.mp4?t=1684433404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
