                        "review": "A fun game to blow 20 hours or so on, simple and quite functional mechanics and a great balance between city builder and RPG. Easy so a great game to play when you're just wanting to kick back and relax.\nThe only thing this game suffers from is lack of variety. Before you finish the final parts of the game you will be sick of the same dozen or so quests over and over. Questing starts to feel like an MMO daily quest grind. Enemy variety is okay for the 20 hour mark, but some more enemies, more quests and just more of what's already in the game in general would elevate this from a good, fun experience to a great experience with endless replayability.\nThat is all that seperates this from a 20 hour fun time and a great game you play over and over.",
